1
00:00:20,920 --> 00:00:23,325
♪Where can love ever be whole?♪

2
00:00:23,434 --> 00:00:27,719
♪When will the bright moon be full?♪

3
00:00:28,320 --> 00:00:30,597
♪Love and hate turn on a single thought♪

4
00:00:30,760 --> 00:00:35,310
♪The past is hard to leave, part,
or sever♪

5
00:00:35,600 --> 00:00:39,002
♪My true heart has never changed♪

6
00:00:40,120 --> 00:00:42,687
♪I wish to become paired swallows
with you♪

7
00:00:43,560 --> 00:00:48,356
♪To meet year after year♪

8
00:00:52,880 --> 00:00:55,816
=Phoenix Rising from the Faint Moon=

9
00:00:55,816 --> 00:00:58,577
(Adapted from the Fanqie Novel
Heaven-Sent Consort & Scheming Prince)

10
00:00:58,625 --> 00:00:59,244
(Author: Yun Jinque)

11
00:01:01,118 --> 00:01:04,082
=Episode 10=

12
00:01:07,000 --> 00:01:07,679
Bravo!

13
00:01:08,079 --> 00:01:09,440
What a duet!

14
00:01:10,280 --> 00:01:11,920
The music is so novel,

15
00:01:12,079 --> 00:01:13,800
the dance style
unlike anything I've ever seen.

16
00:01:14,360 --> 00:01:16,960
Your coordination is simply flawless.

17
00:01:17,519 --> 00:01:18,440
Uncle Yuya,

18
00:01:18,519 --> 00:01:20,119
you've truly married a remarkable woman.

19
00:01:20,760 --> 00:01:23,519
May I ask where you learned this dance,
Aunt Weiyue?

20
00:01:24,760 --> 00:01:25,760
Your Majesty, you flatter us.

21
00:01:25,960 --> 00:01:27,519
It's just a humble skill.

22
00:01:28,320 --> 00:01:29,440
Your Majesty,

23
00:01:30,000 --> 00:01:32,880
this dance isn't some grand,
refined piece at all.

24
00:01:33,519 --> 00:01:37,159
It's just something my husband and I

25
00:01:37,559 --> 00:01:41,519
put together for fun in our chambers.

26
00:01:42,639 --> 00:01:43,719
What's unrefined about it?

27
00:01:44,000 --> 00:01:45,719
It is refined. Truly most refined.

28
00:01:46,639 --> 00:01:47,599
Please, take your seats.

29
00:01:54,599 --> 00:01:56,159
For this Mid-Autumn family banquet,

30
00:01:56,679 --> 00:01:58,000
I have prepared

31
00:01:58,079 --> 00:01:59,679
a little game for all of you.

32
00:02:00,519 --> 00:02:02,039
I've prepared a pot of wine.

33
00:02:02,519 --> 00:02:04,239
It contains dozens of ingredients.

34
00:02:04,559 --> 00:02:07,440
Whoever can correctly name
every ingredient

35
00:02:08,760 --> 00:02:11,000
will receive
this Moonlit Pale Jade Hairpin

36
00:02:11,519 --> 00:02:14,719
- as my prize.
- (That clearly is a tribute item.)

37
00:02:15,679 --> 00:02:17,320
(It must be worth a fortune.)

38
00:02:24,000 --> 00:02:24,719
I'll participate.

39
00:02:32,360 --> 00:02:35,679
Your Majesty, I'd like to try as well.

40
00:02:35,840 --> 00:02:36,480
Very well.

41
00:02:38,000 --> 00:02:42,360
It seems today's contest will be
between the two Feng sisters.

42
00:02:43,920 --> 00:02:46,599
I suggest Your Majesty
make it more interesting

43
00:02:47,000 --> 00:02:48,559
and let everyone place a bet.

44
00:02:50,239 --> 00:02:51,599
What do you think, Uncle Yuya?

45
00:02:52,519 --> 00:02:54,000
Since my sister is so enthusiastic,

46
00:02:54,719 --> 00:02:55,719
I second the motion.

47
00:02:57,320 --> 00:02:57,880
Approved.

48
00:03:01,320 --> 00:03:04,920
I'd like to bet something big
with the Prince of Rong.

49
00:03:07,760 --> 00:03:09,360
I bet Feng Qingyun wins.

50
00:03:10,000 --> 00:03:11,760
If Feng Weiyue loses,

51
00:03:12,280 --> 00:03:16,360
I want the prince's authority
over the Court of Judicial Review.

52
00:03:23,880 --> 00:03:24,679
Sure.

53
00:03:25,159 --> 00:03:28,119
Naturally, I'll bet on my wife.

54
00:03:28,840 --> 00:03:31,440
And if you lose, Xuanji,

55
00:03:32,039 --> 00:03:37,079
then hand over all authority
over water transport to me.

56
00:03:37,320 --> 00:03:38,239
How about that?

57
00:03:39,119 --> 00:03:39,719
Fine.

58
00:03:40,239 --> 00:03:41,719
I'll take that bet.

59
00:03:59,239 --> 00:04:00,440
(Mo Yuya, you...)

60
00:04:00,519 --> 00:04:02,800
(This is forcing me into a corner.)

61
00:04:02,920 --> 00:04:04,559
(I don't know the first thing
about wine.)

62
00:04:08,800 --> 00:04:11,760
(I learned about this game
half a month ago.)

63
00:04:12,280 --> 00:04:14,639
(I've had Feng Qingyun
practicing for days.)

64
00:04:17,440 --> 00:04:20,199
(Mo Yuya, you're going to lose.)

65
00:04:21,440 --> 00:04:24,519
(My wife won't lose.)

66
00:04:40,039 --> 00:04:42,960
(This body actually has this ability?)

67
00:04:42,960 --> 00:04:45,039
Your Majesty, this is
Miss Feng Qingyun's answer.

68
00:04:46,360 --> 00:04:49,360
Your Majesty, I have my answer ready
as well.

69
00:04:51,159 --> 00:04:53,440
But I'd like to say it aloud directly.

70
00:04:57,639 --> 00:04:59,559
What arrogance.

71
00:05:00,239 --> 00:05:02,880
Your Majesty, why don't you
first announce

72
00:05:03,199 --> 00:05:05,039
whether Qingyun got them all right?

73
00:05:05,559 --> 00:05:07,519
That way the princess consort
won't have to speak

74
00:05:07,639 --> 00:05:10,400
and make a fool of herself
with wild guesses.

75
00:05:12,600 --> 00:05:14,480
(Dendrobium, angelica pubescens,
stalactite powder, angelica root, etc.)

76
00:05:17,400 --> 00:05:19,880
Miss Feng Qingyun's guesses
are all correct.

77
00:05:22,920 --> 00:05:24,000
However,

78
00:05:24,000 --> 00:05:26,679
the original wine contains
fifteen ingredients in total.

79
00:05:27,159 --> 00:05:29,559
Miss Feng Qingyun only
got fourteen right.

80
00:05:30,599 --> 00:05:33,159
Let's hear what Aunt Weiyue
has to say.

81
00:05:33,159 --> 00:05:34,159
Yes, Your Majesty.

82
00:05:38,599 --> 00:05:39,920
One jin of mandarin peel,

83
00:05:39,920 --> 00:05:41,119
one jin of eucommia bark,

84
00:05:41,360 --> 00:05:43,360
three taels of hibiscus.

85
00:05:44,400 --> 00:05:46,760
Aconite, astragalus, angelica root,

86
00:05:46,760 --> 00:05:49,679
saposhnikovia root, dried ginger,
cassia heart, and dendrobium,

87
00:05:49,679 --> 00:05:50,360
four taels each.

88
00:05:51,400 --> 00:05:54,239
Cistanche and fluorite, five taels each.

89
00:05:55,440 --> 00:05:59,440
Angelica pubescens, dioscorea rhizoma,
and stalactite powder, eight taels each.

90
00:06:11,920 --> 00:06:12,920
All correct.

91
00:06:13,559 --> 00:06:16,440
She not only correctly
identified all fifteen ingredients,

92
00:06:17,280 --> 00:06:20,039
but even the exact proportions
down to the last detail.

93
00:06:21,079 --> 00:06:23,800
It seems the true wine expert
at tonight's banquet

94
00:06:24,119 --> 00:06:25,440
is my aunt.

95
00:06:26,599 --> 00:06:28,519
Aunt Weiyue, please take a seat.

96
00:06:32,360 --> 00:06:33,599
You love me now, don't you?

97
00:06:39,159 --> 00:06:40,119
Xuanji.

98
00:06:42,079 --> 00:06:43,239
You lost.

99
00:06:47,519 --> 00:06:48,880
You have three days to prepare.

100
00:06:49,360 --> 00:06:52,840
Three days from now, I'll send someone
to your estate

101
00:06:53,400 --> 00:06:55,719
to collect
the water transport account books.

102
00:07:05,020 --> 00:07:06,320
(Mountain Winds, Silent Woods)

103
00:07:06,320 --> 00:07:07,239
Mo Yuya!

104
00:07:11,039 --> 00:07:12,480
This hairpin is mine.

105
00:07:12,800 --> 00:07:14,519
I won it fair and square.

106
00:07:15,400 --> 00:07:16,719
It's mine.

107
00:07:17,159 --> 00:07:18,679
Before the game began,

108
00:07:19,239 --> 00:07:21,000
I discussed it with His Majesty

109
00:07:21,360 --> 00:07:23,239
and added this hairpin as the prize.

110
00:07:25,159 --> 00:07:27,400
You added this game segment

111
00:07:27,519 --> 00:07:28,679
because you wanted to give it to me,
didn't you?

112
00:07:29,960 --> 00:07:31,119
My dear, you're mistaken.

113
00:07:31,599 --> 00:07:33,400
(Mountain Winds, Silent Woods)
I simply wanted to use this chance

114
00:07:34,000 --> 00:07:37,079
to change how the officials see you.

115
00:07:37,360 --> 00:07:39,599
You should be thanking me.

116
00:07:40,119 --> 00:07:43,360
You clearly used that hairpin to lure me

117
00:07:44,039 --> 00:07:46,440
into winning your bet against Mo Xuanji.

118
00:07:49,360 --> 00:07:50,280
You're thinking now.

119
00:07:50,480 --> 00:07:51,280
Good for you.

120
00:07:52,239 --> 00:07:52,880
You...

121
00:07:55,840 --> 00:07:58,480
Then how did you know
I'd definitely win?

122
00:08:00,400 --> 00:08:01,079
I didn't.

123
00:08:02,280 --> 00:08:03,840
But I was willing to trust you.

124
00:08:05,280 --> 00:08:06,719
Because you always surprise me.

125
00:08:07,520 --> 00:08:08,240
Alright now.

126
00:08:10,280 --> 00:08:13,039
This hairpin was always meant for you.

127
00:08:59,279 --> 00:09:01,199
Boss, let me report.

128
00:09:01,520 --> 00:09:04,279
Our noodle shop is booming.

129
00:09:04,600 --> 00:09:07,199
And I've upgraded the menu
with buldak ramen, mixed sauce noodles,

130
00:09:07,359 --> 00:09:08,119
stir-fried instant noodles,

131
00:09:08,319 --> 00:09:09,199
plus our drinks.

132
00:09:09,319 --> 00:09:10,159
I launched combo meals.

133
00:09:10,359 --> 00:09:13,000
Our average customer spend
is through the roof!

134
00:09:13,359 --> 00:09:14,520
Really?

135
00:09:15,079 --> 00:09:16,000
We're rich!

136
00:09:16,319 --> 00:09:17,479
Well, rich is one word for it.

137
00:09:17,760 --> 00:09:20,119
But we're seriously out of stock.

138
00:09:20,279 --> 00:09:21,279
We need to restock.

139
00:09:22,359 --> 00:09:23,000
No problem.

140
00:09:24,319 --> 00:09:25,279
Restock.

141
00:09:34,439 --> 00:09:37,119
This... This seems to be malfunctioning.

142
00:09:38,520 --> 00:09:39,479
No way, boss.

143
00:09:39,720 --> 00:09:42,359
You said this is our only way back
to the 21st century.

144
00:09:42,560 --> 00:09:44,119
If it's wrecked, how do we get home?

145
00:09:44,279 --> 00:09:45,640
How... How would I know?

146
00:09:54,159 --> 00:09:55,920
Your Highness, Mr. Yan is here.

147
00:09:57,960 --> 00:09:58,880
Your Highness.

148
00:09:59,399 --> 00:10:00,039
Thanks to you,

149
00:10:00,039 --> 00:10:01,640
we've achieved two goals at once.

150
00:10:02,840 --> 00:10:03,720
(Account book)
With this,

151
00:10:04,119 --> 00:10:05,680
we can unravel the threads

152
00:10:05,880 --> 00:10:08,439
and find a whole network
of corrupt officials.

153
00:10:09,399 --> 00:10:10,560
She just

154
00:10:11,199 --> 00:10:12,199
handed it over so easily?

155
00:10:13,079 --> 00:10:13,800
Indeed.

156
00:10:14,239 --> 00:10:16,159
Even I find it strange.

157
00:10:25,079 --> 00:10:26,199
Oh, right.

158
00:10:27,520 --> 00:10:29,920
Comparing this with the account records
I had before...

159
00:10:31,239 --> 00:10:31,920
Yan Qi,

160
00:10:32,840 --> 00:10:35,199
the one she gave you is a fake.

161
00:11:00,079 --> 00:11:01,279
What does this mean?

162
00:11:01,840 --> 00:11:03,239
This Space System...

163
00:11:04,560 --> 00:11:05,479
So useless.

164
00:11:09,279 --> 00:11:09,920
Boss.

165
00:11:11,319 --> 00:11:12,119
Boss.

166
00:11:12,680 --> 00:11:14,520
A servant from the Princess's Estate
delivered an invitation.

167
00:11:14,680 --> 00:11:17,760
She's inviting you to
a ladies' tea gathering at her estate.

168
00:11:21,079 --> 00:11:23,039
(Invitation)
Why is she suddenly inviting me?

169
00:11:23,600 --> 00:11:24,960
(Nothing good can come of this.)

170
00:11:28,800 --> 00:11:30,039
What's wrong, boss?

171
00:11:31,520 --> 00:11:32,159
It's nothing.

172
00:11:40,159 --> 00:11:41,920
(Not going.)
Why is brush calligraphy so hard?

173
00:11:58,880 --> 00:11:59,880
Not going?

174
00:12:00,439 --> 00:12:01,279
"Nice" characters.

175
00:12:03,039 --> 00:12:04,600
For me, this is already good.

176
00:12:05,600 --> 00:12:07,600
It's fine. I'll teach you.

177
00:12:17,880 --> 00:12:20,079
(He's still quite handsome.)

178
00:12:26,000 --> 00:12:28,500
(I'll be there.)

179
00:12:31,840 --> 00:12:33,319
What do you mean by this?

180
00:12:34,119 --> 00:12:35,239
I'm not going.

181
00:12:35,399 --> 00:12:37,199
Mo Xuanji is clearly setting a trap.

182
00:12:37,199 --> 00:12:37,880
I won't go.

183
00:12:37,880 --> 00:12:39,079
No way I'm going to be
the sacrificial lamb.

184
00:12:40,159 --> 00:12:41,000
Don't worry.

185
00:12:41,399 --> 00:12:42,600
I'll protect you.

186
00:12:45,880 --> 00:12:47,159
I'm not listening. Not listening.

187
00:12:47,600 --> 00:12:48,239
Mo Yuya,

188
00:12:48,239 --> 00:12:49,199
you only ever scheme for yourself.

189
00:12:49,399 --> 00:12:50,560
You only ever think of yourself.

190
00:12:50,680 --> 00:12:51,640
Do you care about

191
00:12:51,640 --> 00:12:52,359
a common nobody like me?

192
00:12:52,359 --> 00:12:53,199
You don't.

193
00:12:53,359 --> 00:12:54,439
If you cared,

194
00:12:54,439 --> 00:12:55,479
you wouldn't have used me

195
00:12:55,680 --> 00:12:57,560
to make an enemy of the Grand Princess
at the banquet.

196
00:12:59,119 --> 00:13:02,800
What if I told you she had her eye
on you long before that banquet?

197
00:13:03,920 --> 00:13:04,960
Would you believe me?

198
00:13:05,279 --> 00:13:06,560
Like hell I would.

199
00:13:09,720 --> 00:13:11,640
Do you remember what happened
outside your noodle shop?

200
00:13:11,920 --> 00:13:14,079
The time someone kept framing you?

201
00:13:15,640 --> 00:13:18,880
(My mother ate noodles at your shop.)

202
00:13:19,239 --> 00:13:21,000
(That's why she died!)

203
00:13:21,319 --> 00:13:23,239
(Minister, spare me!)

204
00:13:23,319 --> 00:13:25,680
(Chen Hai of Chen's Noodle House
told me to do it!)

205
00:13:25,680 --> 00:13:26,239
(Minister!)

206
00:13:27,920 --> 00:13:33,359
You're saying Mo Xuanji was behind
the noodle shop incident?

207
00:13:54,280 --> 00:13:57,120
♪Dazzling my eyes, impossible to clear♪

208
00:13:57,360 --> 00:13:59,643
♪Mist and clouds lock the frosty sky♪

209
00:14:01,320 --> 00:14:03,681
♪Moon waxes and wanes,
true and false blur♪

210
00:14:04,200 --> 00:14:06,482
♪Coming near, then drifting far♪

211
00:14:07,520 --> 00:14:10,492
♪My heart knows it three thousand times♪

212
00:14:11,080 --> 00:14:13,282
♪Flowers mirrored in clear
shallow water♪

213
00:14:14,440 --> 00:14:18,881
♪Black hair spinning a cocoon,
I step toward love's abyss♪

214
00:14:21,800 --> 00:14:24,161
♪Sword in hand, I spur my horse on♪

215
00:14:24,840 --> 00:14:27,479
♪Love and duty cannot both be whole♪

216
00:14:28,680 --> 00:14:31,280
♪Troubles within and without,
home and realm in peril♪

217
00:14:31,680 --> 00:14:33,841
♪Scattered before my eyes♪

218
00:14:35,120 --> 00:14:38,002
♪Wind and snow cannot blow away
my longing♪

219
00:14:38,400 --> 00:14:40,721
♪Letting go is a kind of fulfillment♪

220
00:14:41,440 --> 00:14:42,640
♪This love remains unchanged♪

221
00:14:42,680 --> 00:14:46,160
♪Yet under the moon I make empty wishes♪

222
00:14:47,920 --> 00:14:50,318
♪Ask not of love's poison,
yearning cannot be cut♪

223
00:14:50,480 --> 00:14:54,440
♪In the mortal world jade shatters,
tears of blood run dry♪

224
00:14:54,840 --> 00:14:57,201
♪Ask again of love's poison,
in whose arms will I sleep♪

225
00:14:57,400 --> 00:14:59,148
♪How can I bear a sweet dream♪

226
00:14:59,148 --> 00:15:00,838
♪Turning into doom♪
(Wedding)

227
00:15:01,640 --> 00:15:04,199
♪A path full of thorns,
time won't wait♪

228
00:15:04,240 --> 00:15:08,521
♪I fear this life won't grant us
tender days together♪

229
00:15:09,040 --> 00:15:10,879
♪I don't regret that vow♪

230
00:15:11,120 --> 00:15:14,355
♪Luckily, the phoenix has fallen
into my heart♪
